# Drizzle
#
# `migrations/meta/` is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds drizzle-kit's journal
# and per-migration schema snapshots, which are how `generate` computes an
# incremental diff. With it ignored, a fresh clone has no state and every
# `drizzle-kit generate` emits a full-schema 0000 that collides with the
# migrations already applied — which is exactly what happened here on
# 2026-08-11. Commit it like any other source of truth.
